{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuWeight","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.LinearCombination"],"declarations":22,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.barInvariant_iff_even","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.barInvariant_iff_even","kind":"theorem","line":366,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L366-L381","doc":"**Bar-invariance fixes only the bar-odd part of the parameter.** Writing `z = h/2 + u`,\nthe trace is bar-invariant iff `u` is bar-even: `u(q) = u(q⁻¹)`.  Any bar-even `u` is allowed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.barInvariant_reflect","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.barInvariant_reflect","kind":"theorem","line":358,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L358-L363","doc":"The mirror `h − z` of a bar-invariant parameter is bar-invariant. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.barInvariant_conventionD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.barInvariant_conventionD","kind":"theorem","line":341,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L341-L356","doc":"Convention D, `z_D = q³/(q²+1)`, is bar-invariant. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.barInvariant_rank","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.barInvariant_rank","kind":"theorem","line":324,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L324-L339","doc":"The rank-`k` Ocneanu parameter `z_k = h q^{2k}/(q^{2k} − 1)` is bar-invariant. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.barInvariant_half","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.barInvariant_half","kind":"theorem","line":317,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L317-L322","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.BarInvariantParam","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.BarInvariantParam","kind":"def","line":314,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L314-L315","doc":"The parameter condition for a bar-invariant Markov trace: `z(q) − z(q⁻¹) = q − q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.transpose_symmetric_iff_half","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.transpose_symmetric_iff_half","kind":"theorem","line":284,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L284-L310","doc":"**The sign-transpose involution has exactly one fixed Markov parameter, `z = h/2`.**\n\nThe weight system is transpose-symmetric (`w_{μ'} = w_μ` for every `μ`) iff `z = (q − q⁻¹)/2`.\nThe `n = 2` pair `(2) ↔ (1,1)` alone already forces it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.ocneanuWeight_row2_transpose","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.ocneanuWeight_row2_transpose","kind":"theorem","line":269,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L269-L282","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.ocneanuWeight_row2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.ocneanuWeight_row2","kind":"theorem","line":258,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L258-L267","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.row2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.row2","kind":"def","line":244,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L244-L256","doc":"The one-row diagram `(2)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.ocneanuWeight_bar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.ocneanuWeight_bar","kind":"theorem","line":218,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L218-L241","doc":"**Bar identity.** `w_μ(q⁻¹, z − h) = w_μ(q, z)`, `h = q − q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.ocneanuWeight_transpose_reflect","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.ocneanuWeight_transpose_reflect","kind":"theorem","line":205,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L205-L216","doc":"**Sign-transpose identity.** `w_{μ'}(q, h − z) = w_μ(q, z)`, `h = q − q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.sum_hookLength","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.sum_hookLength","kind":"theorem","line":186,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L186-L200","doc":"**The hook lengths sum to `Σ_{(i,j)} (i + j + 1)`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.card_col_prefix","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.card_col_prefix","kind":"theorem","line":170,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L170-L184","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.card_row_prefix","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.card_row_prefix","kind":"theorem","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L154-L168","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.sum_card_filter_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.sum_card_filter_comm","kind":"theorem","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L147-L152","doc":"Swap a double count: `Σ_c #{d ∈ s : P c d} = Σ_d #{c ∈ s : P c d}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.hookLength_transpose","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.hookLength_transpose","kind":"theorem","line":138,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L138-L144","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.card_col_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.card_col_le","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L120-L136","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.card_row_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.card_row_le","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L102-L118","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.card_filter_transpose","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.card_filter_transpose","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L97-L100","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.sum_cells_transpose","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.sum_cells_transpose","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L90-L95","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.prod_cells_transpose","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WindowInvolution.prod_cells_transpose","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightWindowInvolution.lean#L83-L88","signatureChu